   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "The meeting between Isabelle Adjani and director Sacha Hartman has completely collapsed. As Isabelle storms out in fury, Camille rushes to find Mathias hiding in his office, paralyzed with panic. Listen to the scene in French first. Don't worry about catching every word.",
