   "t": "D'accord, je viens avec toi.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Let's walk through the tense hallway exchange and panic step by step.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "isabelle",
   "t": "Félicitez Mathias pour son absence.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Congratulate Mathias on his absence.' Isabelle delivers a bitterly sarcastic remark before leaving.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Pour quoi, Isabelle?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'For what, Isabelle?' Camille asks with genuine confusion and concern.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "isabelle",
   "t": "Dites-lui d'attendre un peu.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Tell him to wait awhile.' Isabelle uses a polite imperative directed at the missing agent.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "isabelle",
   "t": "Disons, le reste de ma vie.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Say, the rest of my life.' Isabelle emphasizes that she never wants to hear from him again.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Mathias, c'est la catastrophe!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Mathias, it is a disaster!' Camille bursts into the office in complete panic.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Adjani et Hartman sont partis.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Adjani and Hartman stormed out.' The past tense describes their sudden departure.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Il faut y aller tout de suite!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We must go right away!' Camille urges Mathias to take immediate action.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "mathias",
   "t": "Vas-y, je reste là.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Go on, I am staying here.' Mathias refuses to move, paralyzed by guilt and embarrassment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "mathias",
   "t": "Dis-leur ce que tu veux.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Tell them whatever you want.' Mathias surrenders all control to his assistant.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "mathias",
   "t": "Dis que j'ai disparu.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Say that I have disappeared.' Mathias seeks any possible excuse to hide.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Quoi? Tu es fou?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What? Are you crazy?' Camille is shocked by his complete defeatism.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "mathias",
   "t": "Dis que je suis mort.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Say that I am dead.' Mathias exaggerates his professional ruin with grim despair.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Ce n'est pas toi, ça.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is not you.' Camille firmly challenges his uncharacteristic weakness.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Tu es un battant, un gagnant!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You are a fighter, a winner!' Camille motivates him with powerful words of encouragement.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lea",
   "t": "Allez, lève-toi maintenant!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Come on, get up now!' Camille commands him to snap out of his stupor.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "mathias",
   "t": "D'accord, je viens avec toi.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
